[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13141.59, "timestamp": "03:39:01", "text": "把它放好，并在3点之前寄给他们。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13144.71, "timestamp": "03:39:04", "text": "这是其中之一。所以问题是，呃，我没有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13147.67, "timestamp": "03:39:07", "text": "不知道是不是真的，但我希望是真的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13149.75, "timestamp": "03:39:09", "text": "听起来不错。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13151.59, "timestamp": "03:39:11", "text": "因为他们与种族问题结盟。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13153.67, "timestamp": "03:39:13", "text": "支付费用等等，但需要15分钟。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13157.429, "timestamp": "03:39:17", "text": "20天内所有法律手续都要办完。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13159.19, "timestamp": "03:39:19", "text": "一切都安排妥当了。不会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13162.309, "timestamp": "03:39:22", "text": "是税收还是其他什么法律方面的问题？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13165.03, "timestamp": "03:39:25", "text": "团队成员会向我简要介绍情况。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13167.99, "timestamp": "03:39:27", "text": "我想大概以后吧。嗯，他们是这么说的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13169.99, "timestamp": "03:39:29", "text": "即使我身处其中，我也问了所有问题。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13174.07, "timestamp": "03:39:34", "text": "日本将会积极参与。所以我觉得……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13176.79, "timestamp": "03:39:36", "text": "自美元以来"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13181.83, "timestamp": "03:39:41", "text": "自从美元那件事……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13186.229, "timestamp": "03:39:46", "text": "呃，就像……嗯，大多数人喜欢什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13188.79, "timestamp": "03:39:48", "text": "我们的印度观众他们无法发送"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13191.11, "timestamp": "03:39:51", "text": "对，都是因为PayPal那一套。所以，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13193.83, "timestamp": "03:39:53", "text": "我觉得如果我用剃刀来形容的话"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13197.03, "timestamp": "03:39:57", "text": "Payne me link 在描述中或"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13198.71, "timestamp": "03:39:58", "text": "某物"}]